  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Grassroot funds and women-led Community-based organisations for Gender-Just Climate Solutions worldwide</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mama Cash brings expertise in donor influencing, cross-movement collaboration and the inclusion of a feminist approach throughout GAGGA&#x2019;s actions. It brings to GAGGA a track record of supporting and strengthening women-led CBOs, funds, and movements to effect substantive social and environmental change via L&amp;A worldwide. While working globally it is based in the Netherlands and plays an active role in drawing attention of Dutch society to issues of women&#x2019;s rights, climate justice and inclusion.</narrative>
  </description>
